    "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(skill): replace broken skill-tools filtering with glob prefix matching by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2166\n* fix: remove skill search reminders and related infrastructure by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2168\n* fix(gpt): align Codex prompt and shell tool exposure by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2176\n* fix(gpt): correct Tengu AgentToolHook wrapper script alias by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2177\n* feat: compact GPT tool surface with hidden tool registration by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2179\n* fix(gpt): update reasoning format instruction to accept both We need and Need by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2178\n* feat(tool-script): add exec_command parameter schema with yield_time_ms and workdir by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2180\n* fix(provider): use 128K output defaults for large models by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2181\n* fix(provider): align large-model output and compaction reserves by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2182\n* fix(tool): keep exec gateway available under GPT tool filtering by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2183\n* fix(session): preserve automatic harness inference by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2192\n* feat(session): persist prompt and harness selection by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2191\n* fix(tool): sync max_output_tokens command translator to main by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2201\n* fix(tool): resolve MCP-prefixed tool aliases by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2202\n* feat(provider): route Xiaomi PTC through Responses custom exec by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2203\n* fix(session): defer text part creation until first delta by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2193\n* fix(skill): pdf-official CJK font protocol — verified TTF ladder, CID fallback, never Helvetica by @oscar-cao7 in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2189\n* refactor(skill): move drive-mimo to repository scope by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2210\n* fix(tool): repair custom exec parameter compatibility by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2211\n* feat(session): support append-only interrupted turn recovery by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2205\n* feat(exec): persist replayable nested tool parts by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2222\n* feat(skill): add mate builtin skill for desktop pet creation by @oscar-cao7 in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2225\n* fix: restrict subagent actor calls to send action only by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2223\n* feat: add subagent progress notifications by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2217\n* feat: auto-worktree soft hint injection by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2227\n* Remove change_directory and clarify shell path usage by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2239\n* refactor(session): centralize provider retry coordination by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2216\n* Restore session cwd SDK compatibility and regenerate API by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2241\n* fix: default checkpoint writer to fork mode by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2246\n* fix: gate GPT toolset on resolved API model for mimo by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2243\n* fix: simplify MiMo model harness selection by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2252\n* Allow relative paths within the workspace by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2251\n* feat(sdk): expose reliable genTitle API by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2228\n* fix(session): preserve prompt cache prefixes by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2258\n* fix(actor): scope fork contexts by session by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2259\n* feat(session): add MIMOCODE_COMPACTION_MAX_CONTEXT flag by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2260\n* fix(session): fire compaction at a flat 90% of the context window by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2263\n* fix(session): scope replace-agent base override to main/peer actors by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2264\n* fix(actor): drop the unimplemented spawn/run resume argument by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2262\n* feat(pptx-official): image sourcing decision rules by @oscar-cao7 in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2265\n* test(session): retune the auto-overflow fixture for the flat 90% trigger by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2266\n* fix(mcp): record local startup exit code and stderr tail; scope ask-timeout env in tests by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2269\n* fix(session): fire auto-worktree notice on main-worktree mutations by path by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2270\n* fix(permission): same-session subagents inherit parent grants by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2273\n* feat(session): collapse rebuild tail into activity log by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2275\n* session: keep errored assistants as recovery candidates by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2279\n* feat(session): request-layer loop-streak recovery (opt-in) by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2278\n* feat(session): decouple instruction-file injection from the dynamic system prompt flag by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2285\n* feat(session): freeze the per-session system prefix in a persistent snapshot by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2289\n* feat(session): move skill catalogs from user messages to the system tail by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2287\n* fix(build): prevent ancestor node_modules bun from hijacking compiled… by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2291\n* feat(config): add auto_worktree toggle, default off by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2292\n* fix(llm-server): advertise Server.listen so issue can resolve base_url by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2293\n* fix(build-node): define MIMOCODE_VERSION for node target by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2297\n* feat(session): project compaction as a summary plus compression-time tail by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2294\n* fix(mcp): show MiMoCode branding in OAuth pages and client registration by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2301\n* chore(prompt): rewrite Tools section as Using your tools guidance by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2302\n* fix(codex): allow explicit default harness for GPT by @MiMoHardFather in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2303\n* fix(provider): stabilize defaultModel fallback (no menu-priority sort) by @wqymi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2306\n* fix(compose-next): require spec to land in the worktree by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2307\n* feat(tui): voice control via voice_input tool with caret/selection by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2308\n* fix(tui): restore voice_input schema shape and tolerate missing tool name by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2309\n* chore(sdk): regenerate openapi and js sdk types by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2310\n* chore: bump version to 0.1.14 by @yanyihan-xiaomi in https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/pull/2311\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/compare/v0.1.13...v0.1.14",
